{"seq":33,"slug":"ai-evaluation-redteam","title":"AI 产品评测与红队","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-产品评测与红队-简介\">AI 产品评测与红队 简介</h1><p>AI 产品的评测与红队是产品工程化的核心能力之一。在大模型输出概率性、行为难以预测、上线后行为可能漂移的现实下，传统软件的&quot;测试通过即可发布&quot;已经不足以保证 AI 产品的质量与安全。需要一套独有的评测体系——评测集构建、人工标注流水线、红队对抗测试、自动化评测工具、上线后持续监控——共同形成 AI 产品的质量护城河。本手册系统讲解这套体系的工程实践，帮助团队建立从研发到运营的完整 AI 评测能力。</p>\n<p>本手册面向 AI 产品工程师、SRE、安全工程师、QA 工程师、产品负责人等需要主导 AI 评测体系建设的从业者。我们假设读者熟悉基本的软件测试与 CI/CD 流程，目标是建立 AI 评测特有的工程能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[AI 评测与红队] --&gt; B[第1章 评测体系基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第2章 红队方法论]&#10;    A --&gt; D[第3章 自动化评测工具]&#10;    A --&gt; E[第4章 上线后运营]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[评测集构建]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[采样策略]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[人工标注]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[版本化]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[攻击分类]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[越狱技术]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[防御方法]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[红队流程]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[LLM-as-Judge]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[评测框架]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[CI 集成]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[用户反馈]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[漂移检测]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[回归保护]\">graph TD\n    A[AI 评测与红队] --&gt; B[第1章 评测体系基础]\n    A --&gt; C[第2章 红队方法论]\n    A --&gt; D[第3章 自动化评测工具]\n    A --&gt; E[第4章 上线后运营]\n    B --&gt; B1[评测集构建]\n    B --&gt; B2[采样策略]\n    B --&gt; B3[人工标注]\n    B --&gt; B4[版本化]\n    C --&gt; C1[攻击分类]\n    C --&gt; C2[越狱技术]\n    C --&gt; C3[防御方法]\n    C --&gt; C4[红队流程]\n    D --&gt; D1[LLM-as-Judge]\n    D --&gt; D2[评测框架]\n    D --&gt; D3[CI 集成]\n    E --&gt; E1[用户反馈]\n    E --&gt; E2[漂移检测]\n    E --&gt; E3[回归保护]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适用读者</td>\n<td>AI 产品工程师、SRE、安全工程师、QA、产品负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置知识</td>\n<td>熟悉基本软件测试与 CI/CD；了解 LLM 应用的基本架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心目标</td>\n<td>建立 AI 产品从研发到运营的完整评测与红队能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容深度</td>\n<td>中级，重工程实践</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习产出</td>\n<td>能设计评测集、组织红队测试、建立 CI 评测、运营上线后监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>全书共分为四个章节，按照&quot;评测集构建 → 红队测试 → 自动化 → 长期运营&quot;的工程链路组织。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>AI 评测体系基础</strong>讲解评测集的构建工艺。评测集构建是 AI 产品工程化的起点，也是 90% 团队面临的瓶颈。本章覆盖评测集的设计原则、采样策略（覆盖典型与边界）、人工标注流水线、版本化管理。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>红队测试方法论</strong>专门讨论 AI 产品的对抗性测试。与传统软件的安全测试不同，AI 产品有独特的攻击面——越狱、prompt 注入、数据泄露、不当工具使用。本章给出系统的攻击分类、典型攻击模式、防御方法、与红队团队的工作流程。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>自动化评测工具</strong>讲解把评测从人工劳动转为自动化系统的工程实践。LLM-as-Judge 让大规模自动评测可行；Promptfoo、DeepEval、Braintrust 等开源框架提供了成熟基础设施；与 CI 的集成让评测成为发布门禁的一部分。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>上线后评测运营</strong>关注产品上线后的长期质量保证。真实用户反馈的采集与分析、模型行为漂移的早期发现、新版本与旧版本的回归保护——这些是让 AI 产品长期稳定的运营能力。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：第一章是基础，必须最先掌握。然后根据团队优先级选择第二章（安全敏感场景）或第三章（工程化场景）深入。第四章作为长期运营的指南，建议在产品即将上线前重点研读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eval-system-foundations","title":"AI 评测体系基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/eval-system-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-eval-sets","title":"评测集构建方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/eval-system-foundations/building-eval-sets"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-strategies","title":"评测集采样策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/eval-system-foundations/sampling-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-annotation-workflows","title":"人工标注工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/eval-system-foundations/human-annotation-workflows"},{"seq":4,"slug":"eval-set-versioning","title":"评测集版本化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/eval-system-foundations/eval-set-versioning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"red-team-methodology","title":"红队测试方法论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/red-team-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attack-taxonomy","title":"AI 攻击分类法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/red-team-methodology/attack-taxonomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"jailbreak-techniques","title":"越狱技术与防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/red-team-methodology/jailbreak-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-injection-defense","title":"Prompt 注入防御","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/red-team-methodology/prompt-injection-defense"},{"seq":4,"slug":"red-team-workflow","title":"红队工作流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/red-team-methodology/red-team-workflow"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-eval-harness","title":"自动化评测工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/automated-eval-harness","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"llm-as-judge","title":"LLM-as-Judge：自动化评测的核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/automated-eval-harness/llm-as-judge"},{"seq":2,"slug":"eval-harness-frameworks","title":"评测 Harness 框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/automated-eval-harness/eval-harness-frameworks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-integration","title":"评测与 CI 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/automated-eval-harness/ci-integration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"post-launch-evaluation","title":"上线后评测运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/post-launch-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-user-feedback","title":"真实用户反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/post-launch-evaluation/real-user-feedback"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-detection","title":"漂移检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/post-launch-evaluation/drift-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"regression-protection","title":"回归保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-redteam/post-launch-evaluation/regression-protection"}]}]}